# Scratch space for throwaway working files — screenshot downloads, probe
# harnesses, render checks. Never a source of truth.
#
# ⚠ SAFETY, NOT TIDINESS. `.scratch/quarantine/` holds the FULL-RESOLUTION
# export of Figma node `30:2`. Amended 2026-08-18: the artwork is Gerald's own,
# so it is not client-engagement material and the node itself is no longer
# excluded — a downscaled copy ships as
# `src/assets/img/home-proof-automation-split.jpg`. What is still forbidden is
# THIS file: at native resolution its right-hand half renders legible source
# code, which AGENTS.md rule 4 bars from a PUBLIC repository independently of
# who owns the picture. Without this line `git add .` stages it. Do not remove
# this line, and do not move anything out of quarantine — the content-hash gate
# in AGENTS.md compares against this copy and needs it to stay put.
.scratch/
